# GeT-RM reference material, Coriell ID NA06991 (CEPH/Utah Pedigree 1341).
# GeT-RM genotype-level data (Tier1_c.2846A>T = A/T heterozygous; all other
# Tier 1 positions homozygous reference) retrieved via Coriell's GeT-RM PGx
# Search tool (https://www.coriell.org/GeTRM/PGxSearch, gene=DPYD),
# 2026-08-17. Source study: Gaedigk A et al., "Characterization of
# Reference Materials for DPYD: A GeT-RM Collaborative Project." J Mol
# Diagn 2024;26:864-875 (PMID 39032822).
#
# A clean, single-locus D949V (decreased function) heterozygous carrier --
# useful as a contrast case against HG00118 (fixtures/getrm/dpyd/HG00118.vcf),
# which carries the same D949V variant but ALSO a second independent
# non-reference locus. HapB3 exonic tag (c.1236G>A) genotype for this
# sample was not retrieved this session (browser-tool instability cut off
# data collection before this column could be confirmed) -- represented as
# a no-call below rather than fabricated. Does not affect the result:
# HapB3-intronic is confirmed homozygous reference.
